        <mxCell id="NKc8lnMmxln-4O3GPi_p-1" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=#666666;" value="Design a system where you return top pages for the home screen. Top is decided by some metric, say likes, shares and views. The top screen needs to refreshed when new top pages come in. The top suggestions page should be renderable in any device, mobile, tablet, desktop.&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;Followup: Top is based on user recommendations.&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;Functional&#xa;Fetch top pages for home screen&#xa;Support real-time / near-real-time updates&#xa;Support personalization per user&#xa;Device-agnostic rendering&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;Non-Functional&#xa;Low latency (&lt;100ms P99)&#xa;High availability&#xa;Scalable to millions of users&#xa;Eventually consistent rankings acceptable" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="310" width="560" x="40" y="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
